20
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:53,120
Your mother changed her testimony
about Tuang's car accident.

21
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:56,120
Now Tuang is facing criminal charges
and can't leave the country.

22
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:02,120
