42
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,360
Would you like an apple?

43
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,600
Thank you.

44
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,560
Chris.

45
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:49,560
Welcome to the Pornhova Church family.

46
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,160
Chris, go talk to Uncle Sadudee.

47
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Yes, Mom.

48
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,680
Excuse me.

49
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:06,440
Next time you attend
a church service or activity,

50
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:10,360
please dress more appropriately.

51
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:14,480
We value propriety here.

52
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,240
Thank you for understanding.
Please make yourself comfortable.

53
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:34,280
STEVEJOB123 JOINED PORNHOVA CHURCH GROUP

